{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-7xdsd","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-8w8zd","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:selections:chips:itemsSpacing:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-2l8cv","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-7905f","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:tableName:bundle:selections:chips:itemsSpacing:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A picker allowing to expose several ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"filter chips"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and proposing single or multiple selections.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSChipPickerV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSChipPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"OUDSChipPicker","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSChipPicker","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSChipPicker"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each chip contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose choosen values through this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSFilterChip","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPickerData","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"text":"Code samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in filter chip using OUDSChipPickerData.","    enum Drink: String, CaseIterable {","        case virginHolyLava, ipaBeer, mineralWater","    }","","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSChipPickerData<Drink>] {","        [","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.virginHolyLava,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"Virgin Holy Lava\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")))),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.ipaBeer,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"IPA Beer\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")))),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.mineralWater,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"Mineral water\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")))),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/\/ Single selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: Drink = .mineralWater","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selection: $selection, chips: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/\/ Multiple selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [Drink] = [.mineralWater]","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selections: $selections, chips: someDataToPopulate)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2,"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no online specification as this component is not an official OUDS one."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Theme-rendering","level":2,"text":"Theme rendering","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Orange","level":3,"text":"Orange","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","level":3,"text":"Orange Compact","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sosh","level":3,"text":"Sosh","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wireframe","level":3,"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Wireframe","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.17.0","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudschippicker"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker"},"sections":[],"references":{"component_chipPicker_Wireframe":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_chipPicker_Wireframe.png"}],"type":"image","identifier":"component_chipPicker_Wi